{"title": "Countermeasure", "pageid": 35624, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Countermeasure", "categories": ["Creatures", "Races", "Non-playable races"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Countermeasures</b> are hostile Aberration creatures in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a></i> that may appear during the fight <a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain#Atop_the_Netherbrain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\">Atop the Netherbrain</a> depending upon the party's choices during the <a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\">Confront the Elder Brain</a> quest.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Breaker_of_War_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Breaker_of_War_Model.png/300px-Breaker_of_War_Model.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Breaker_of_War_Model.png/450px-Breaker_of_War_Model.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Breaker_of_War_Model.png/600px-Breaker_of_War_Model.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Breaker_of_War_Model.png/300px-Breaker_of_War_Model.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"524\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Breaker_of_War_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  A Countermeasure  </div></figcaption></figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About\">About</span></h2>\n<p>Four Countermeasures are created by the <a href=\"/wiki/Netherbrain\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Netherbrain\">Netherbrain</a> if the party chose to trust <a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\">The Emperor</a> and allow him, a <a href=\"/wiki/Full-Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Illithid\">Full-Illithid</a> player character, or Full-Illithid <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a> to consume <a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\">Orpheus</a>. They are designed to both mimic and counter the specific classes of characters in the active party. They only appear during the final battle <a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain#Atop_the_Netherbrain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\">Atop the Netherbrain</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tactics\">Tactics</span></h2>\n<p>Countermeasures are intended to be effective against the classes they mimick. For example, the <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a> has the <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Resistance\" title=\"Magic Resistance\">Magic Resistance</a> passive, Resistance to fire, cold, and lightning damage, and can cast <a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\">Counterspell</a>, making them more difficult for Wizards to deal with. It may be advisable to fight different countermeasures with members of the party who are not countered by them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Countermeasure_class_variants\">Countermeasure class variants</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li>Barbarian: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rage_Queller\" title=\"Rage Queller\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Rage_Queller.png/25px-Portrait_Rage_Queller.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Rage_Queller.png/38px-Portrait_Rage_Queller.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Rage_Queller.png/50px-Portrait_Rage_Queller.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rage Queller\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Rage_Queller.png/25px-Portrait_Rage_Queller.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Portrait_Rage_Queller.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rage_Queller\" title=\"Rage Queller\">Rage Queller</a></li>\n<li>Bard: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Snapping_of_Strings\" title=\"The Snapping of Strings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/07/Portrait_The_Snapping_of_Strings.png/25px-Portrait_The_Snapping_of_Strings.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/07/Portrait_The_Snapping_of_Strings.png/38px-Portrait_The_Snapping_of_Strings.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/07/Portrait_The_Snapping_of_Strings.png/50px-Portrait_The_Snapping_of_Strings.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Snapping of Strings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/07/Portrait_The_Snapping_of_Strings.png/25px-Portrait_The_Snapping_of_Strings.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/07/Portrait_The_Snapping_of_Strings.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Snapping_of_Strings\" title=\"The Snapping of Strings\">The Snapping of Strings</a></li>\n<li>Cleric: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blasphemous_Acolyte\" title=\"Blasphemous Acolyte\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Portrait_Blasphemous_Acolyte.png/25px-Portrait_Blasphemous_Acolyte.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Portrait_Blasphemous_Acolyte.png/38px-Portrait_Blasphemous_Acolyte.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Portrait_Blasphemous_Acolyte.png/50px-Portrait_Blasphemous_Acolyte.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blasphemous Acolyte\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Portrait_Blasphemous_Acolyte.png/25px-Portrait_Blasphemous_Acolyte.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Portrait_Blasphemous_Acolyte.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blasphemous_Acolyte\" title=\"Blasphemous Acolyte\">Blasphemous Acolyte</a></li>\n<li>Druid: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unnatural_Blot\" title=\"Unnatural Blot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Portrait_Unnatural_Blot.png/25px-Portrait_Unnatural_Blot.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Portrait_Unnatural_Blot.png/38px-Portrait_Unnatural_Blot.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Portrait_Unnatural_Blot.png/50px-Portrait_Unnatural_Blot.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unnatural Blot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Portrait_Unnatural_Blot.png/25px-Portrait_Unnatural_Blot.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Portrait_Unnatural_Blot.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unnatural_Blot\" title=\"Unnatural Blot\">Unnatural Blot</a></li>\n<li>Fighter: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Breaker_of_War\" title=\"Breaker of War\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Breaker_of_War.png/25px-Portrait_Breaker_of_War.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Breaker_of_War.png/38px-Portrait_Breaker_of_War.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Breaker_of_War.png/50px-Portrait_Breaker_of_War.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Breaker of War\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Breaker_of_War.png/25px-Portrait_Breaker_of_War.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Breaker_of_War.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Breaker_of_War\" title=\"Breaker of War\">Breaker of War</a></li>\n<li>Monk: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Way_of_the_Profane_Ki\" title=\"Way of the Profane Ki\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Portrait_Way_of_the_Profane_Ki.png/25px-Portrait_Way_of_the_Profane_Ki.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Portrait_Way_of_the_Profane_Ki.png/38px-Portrait_Way_of_the_Profane_Ki.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Portrait_Way_of_the_Profane_Ki.png/50px-Portrait_Way_of_the_Profane_Ki.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Way of the Profane Ki\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Portrait_Way_of_the_Profane_Ki.png/25px-Portrait_Way_of_the_Profane_Ki.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Portrait_Way_of_the_Profane_Ki.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Way_of_the_Profane_Ki\" title=\"Way of the Profane Ki\">Way of the Profane Ki</a></li>\n<li>Paladin: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oathless_Wretch\" title=\"Oathless Wretch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Oathless_Wretch.png/25px-Portrait_Oathless_Wretch.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Oathless_Wretch.png/38px-Portrait_Oathless_Wretch.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Oathless_Wretch.png/50px-Portrait_Oathless_Wretch.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oathless Wretch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Oathless_Wretch.png/25px-Portrait_Oathless_Wretch.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Portrait_Oathless_Wretch.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oathless_Wretch\" title=\"Oathless Wretch\">Oathless Wretch</a></li>\n<li>Ranger: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Darkening_Hunt\" title=\"The Darkening Hunt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png/25px-Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png/38px-Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png/50px-Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Darkening Hunt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png/25px-Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Portrait_The_Darkening_Hunt.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Darkening_Hunt\" title=\"The Darkening Hunt\">The Darkening Hunt</a></li>\n<li>Rogue: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Assassin%27s_Folly\" title=\"Assassin's Folly\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Portrait_Assassin%27s_Folly.png/25px-Portrait_Assassin%27s_Folly.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Portrait_Assassin%27s_Folly.png/38px-Portrait_Assassin%27s_Folly.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Portrait_Assassin%27s_Folly.png/50px-Portrait_Assassin%27s_Folly.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Assassin's Folly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Portrait_Assassin%27s_Folly.png/25px-Portrait_Assassin%27s_Folly.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Portrait_Assassin%27s_Folly.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Assassin%27s_Folly\" title=\"Assassin's Folly\">Assassin's Folly</a></li>\n<li>Sorcerer: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Metamage_Persecutor\" title=\"Metamage Persecutor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Metamage_Persecutor.png/25px-Portrait_Metamage_Persecutor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Metamage_Persecutor.png/38px-Portrait_Metamage_Persecutor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Metamage_Persecutor.png/50px-Portrait_Metamage_Persecutor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Metamage Persecutor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Metamage_Persecutor.png/25px-Portrait_Metamage_Persecutor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Metamage_Persecutor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Metamage_Persecutor\" title=\"Metamage Persecutor\">Metamage Persecutor</a></li>\n<li>Warlock: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pactsplitter\" title=\"Pactsplitter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Pactsplitter.png/25px-Portrait_Pactsplitter.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Pactsplitter.png/38px-Portrait_Pactsplitter.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Pactsplitter.png/50px-Portrait_Pactsplitter.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pactsplitter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Pactsplitter.png/25px-Portrait_Pactsplitter.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Portrait_Pactsplitter.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pactsplitter\" title=\"Pactsplitter\">Pactsplitter</a></li>\n<li>Wizard: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Portrait_Spellplague.png/25px-Portrait_Spellplague.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Portrait_Spellplague.png/38px-Portrait_Spellplague.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Portrait_Spellplague.png/50px-Portrait_Spellplague.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spellplague\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Portrait_Spellplague.png/25px-Portrait_Spellplague.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Portrait_Spellplague.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<ul><li>If a character is multi-classed then their countermeasure is randomly selected from among their classes.</li>\n<li>Countermeasures have 4 character models, each of which is always used during the final battle.</li>\n<li>Most countermeasures arguably fail to live up to their name, particularly against experienced and well prepared players. Some do not have any abilities or powers that effectively counter a character's class and are simply a variant of that class; e.g., Paladin countermeasure is just a (weak) <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">Paladin</a>, where a more effective 'countermeasure' would have been a Death Knight or something with Radiant Retort.</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li::after{content:\" · \";font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li:last-child::after{content:none}.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt::after{content:\":\";font-weight:normal;font-size:100%}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd li:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt li:first-